OL,3,AOscar-winning actress Eva Marie Saint
OL,4,Adies aged 102
OL,5,
OL,6,FEva Marie Saint, the Oscar-winning
OL,7,Factress who starred in Hollywood
OL,8,Fclassics such as On the Waterfront and
OL,9,FNorth by Northwest, has died aged 102.
OL,11,FSaint won the Academy Award for best
OL,12,Fsupporting actress for her movie debut
OL,13,Fin director Elia Kazan's 1954 crime
OL,14,Fdrama, On the Waterfront; playing Edie
OL,15,FDoyle, the moral compass of the film
OL,16,Fand love interest of Marlon Brando's
OL,17,Fconflicted boxer-turned-docker.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
