OL,3,AGavin and Stacey creators Jones and
OL,4,ACorden reveal celebrity cast of new
OL,5,Ashow
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe pair previously said the idea came
OL,8,Ffrom their family connection to choirs,
OL,9,Fwith Corden's mum and Jones' sister
OL,10,Fboth members of one.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/19
